one":"America/Chicago"}},{"id":"0a0c8cfd09fa4952bf237e7c950c6714","metadata":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-14T15:28:48.037151Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-14T15:28:48.037151Z","groupId":"a40512a2e64f4c00b5fd6c4f3a6fb7fa","userId":"b1e175eb5cdd48bdb14e3885b5d32423","rating":5,"body":"AI consultant in Germany, my clients are small and medium manufacturers and service companies, mostly still running on paper. Nate's AI operating system course made me rebuild my own business on one first, and that system is now what I sell. Best offer I've ever had. But what I love most are the daily injections: his videos, his posts, his business ideas. They're my daily inspiration, and something from them lands in my own system almost every week. Thank you, Nate 🙏 Greetings from Germany 👋","memberSince":"2026-04-11T00:27:20.133528Z","memberCurrentlyPaying":true,"user":{"id":"b1e175eb5cdd48bdb14e3885b5d32423","name":"florian-maier-2020","metadata":{"bio":"Ex-CMO, Dr./Phd, 48, Certified AI Consultant/ AI Agent Builder, Coach, 25+ yrs Marketing, father of 2, Bayreuth, Shanghai, Munich, Hamburg, Wetzlar.","lastOffline":1793572327503782400,"linkFacebook":"","linkInstagram":"","linkLinkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/florianmaier/","linkTwitter":"","linkWebsite":"http://www.8komma3.de","linkYoutube":"","location":"Wetzlar, Germany","myersBriggs":"ENFP","pictureBubble":"https://assets.skool.com/f/b1e175eb5cdd48bdb14e3885b5d32423/481c9afca70841e6927e5d11355dc03c04c01cd610644b5eb430840fb48a36b3-sm.jpg","pictureProfile":"https://assets.skool.com/f/b1e175eb5cdd48bdb14e3885b5d32423/481c9afca70841e6927e5d11355dc03c04c01cd610644b5eb430840fb48a36b3","spData":"{\"pts\":57,\"lv\":3,\"pcl\":20,\"pnl\":65,\"role\":4}"},"createdAt":"2024-05-21T15:10:46.868927Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-01T22:32:07.505704Z","email":"","firstName":"Florian","lastName":"Maier","timeZone":"Europe/Berlin"}},{"id":"acc187982a144cce9fe26343c2dd0c33","metadata":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-21T16:47:53.921165Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-21T16:47:53.921165Z","groupId":"a40512a2e64f4c00b5fd6c4f3a6fb7fa","userId":"ac9a799f8067470d9aa483a2f5de9ffc","rating":5,"body":"I am a life-long learner. I've sat through webinars, watched countless videos, listened to blogs, and attended summits. Every time I come away with ideas and the overwhelming desire to act. But they all have one thing in common, not one of them has showed me HOW.\n\nAIS+ is different. I have endless resources in this community that not only explain workflows and tools , but show you how to use them. They teach you, build with you, encourage and supports you. Do it, you won't regret it.\n","memberSince":"2026-01-31T01:53:36.107369Z","memberCurrentlyPaying":true,"user":{"id":"ac9a799f8067470d9aa483a2f5de9ffc","name":"dave-simpson-2921","metadata":{"bio":"Husband/wife owners of an award-winning boutique marketing studio, Simpatico Design Studio. StoryBrand Certified/MV AI Masters/Hermes Award Winners","lastOffline":1793375056720965600,"linkFacebook":"https://www.facebook.com/SimpaticoDesignStudio","linkInstagram":"http://instagram.com/simpaticodesignstudio","linkLinkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/simpaticodesignstudio","linkTwitter":"","linkWebsite":"http://www.simapticodesignstudio.com","linkYoutube":"","location":"Fredericksburg, Virginia","pictureBubble":"https://assets.skool.com/f/ac9a799f8067470d9aa483a2f5de9ffc/8d006babf2fb4be1a95f307239e8a703b517cbe9d1e7423991216529a753a007-sm.jpg","pictureProfile":"https://assets.skool.com/f/ac9a799f8067470d9aa483a2f5de9ffc/8d006babf2fb4be1a95f307239e8a703b517cbe9d1e7423991216529a753a007.jpg","spData":"{\"pts\":251,\"lv\":5,\"pcl\":155,\"pnl\":515,\"role\":4}"},"createdAt":"2026-01-31T01:51:09.692252Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-02T23:14:18.353177Z","email":"","firstName":"Dave-Amy","lastName":"Simpson","timeZone":"America/New_York"}},{"id":"2c861c221fc74de7a553cefa6c24663d","metadata":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-14T17:18:30.970299Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:18:30.970299Z","groupId":"a40512a2e64f4c00b5fd6c4f3a6fb7fa","userId":"56310fdfa6d740039d93b92bee3c2348","rating":5,"body":"I am a July member of AIS+ and part of the AIS free skool for about 8 months.  My experience has been overwhelmingly positive.  My key takeaways: the content is very well done and in a space that is changing as rapidly as AI the content that Nate & team have put in place has held up remarkably well.  The members in both communities are the most supportive and collaborative I have seen anywhere on line - zero haters.  Can't think of another platform/community demonstrating that.","memberSince":"2026-07-16T14:03:33.126647Z","memberCurrentlyPaying":true,"user":{"id":"56310fdfa6d740039d93b92bee3c2348","name":"don-jefe-7764","metadata":{"bio":"Ex-Exec, Engineer, Builder, Going back to my roots.","lastOffline":1793649059153513500,"linkFacebook":"","linkInstagram":"","linkLinkedin":"","linkTwitter":"","linkWebsite":"","linkYoutube":"","location":"New York","pictureBubble":"https://assets.skool.com/f/56310fdfa6d740039d93b92bee3c2348/5838ddde807c4b318b670ded21615b118e4cebf89465402b95601c64835ab848-sm.jpg","pictureProfile":"https://assets.skool.com/f/56310fdfa6d740039d93b92bee3c2348/5838ddde807c4b318b670ded21615b118e4cebf89465402b95601c64835ab848-md.jpg","spData":"{\"pts\":231,\"lv\":5,\"pcl\":155,\"pnl\":515,\"role\":4}"},"createdAt":"2026-03-24T18:15:47.376801Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-02T19:50:59.154392Z","email":"","firstName":"Jon","lastName":"Geist","timeZone":"America/New_York"}},{"id":"8ece37d8f2864fcaa71b9c8ba2c67a8c","metadata":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-16T17:03:19.182137Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-16T17:03:19.182137Z","groupId":"a40512a2e64f4c00b5fd6c4f3a6fb7fa","userId":"6a26e0aadd044f7582155a5a2bee633a","rating":5,"body":"Both the AIS and AIS+ communities are amazing when it comes to learning and building your AI skillset. Nate's teaching is easily understandable yet simultaneously very impactful. Other content producers in this space are sometimes hard to follow, like watching a squirrel on speed, 